 &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 5.35pt;&quot;&gt;The
     proposed hours of use would result in increased levels of activity from a
     restaurant use late into the evening, that would in turn generate adverse
     noise impacts nearer to the quiet residential amenities of neighbours
     within close proximity of the site. As such, the proposal would therefore
     be contrary to Harrow Development Management Policies DM1 and DM 38A.b and
     London Plan Policy D14.&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
